      <h2>Bun<sub>G</sub> Seminar</h2>

      <p>
     <p>
  In January 2023, I co-founded the University of Chicago
  Bun<sub>G</sub> Seminar with Aaron Slipper and subsequently organized it
  for seven consecutive quarters. The seminar was devoted to studying the geometry
  and representation theory of the moduli stack of principal bundles on a
  curve. It provided background for UChicago's Geometric
  Langlands Seminar and featured talks by many experts in the field, including Sasha Beilinson, Ngô Bảo Châu, 
Victor Ginzburg,

  Nick Rozenblyum, and Zhiwei Yun.
</p>
